Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: parser.c
Line: 3495
Function: xmlExpandPEsInEntityValue
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Inside the loop guarded only by (str < end), the code accesses str[1] when c == '&'. If the last byte of the entity value is '&' (i.e., str == end - 1), reading str[1] reads one byte past the end of the buffer. This is a concrete OOB read that can be triggered by an entity value ending with '&'.

